OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI to increase number of
OL,4,Aofficers carrying tasers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Northern Ireland's top police
OL,7,Fofficers has said that the service will
OL,8,Ftake steps to increase the number of
OL,9,Fteams carrying tasers.
OL,11,FIt comes after 850 assaults on officers
OL,12,Fwere reported from 6 September 2025 to
OL,13,F6 September 2026.
OL,15,FThe Police Federation of Northern
OL,16,FIreland has welcomed the plans and has
OL,17,Furged the service to move at pace given
OL,18,Fthe "extent of assaults".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
