OL,3,GNEWSAPSNI to increase number of
OL,4,Aofficers carrying tasers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Chief Constable Bobby Singleton
OL,7,Fsaid officers may use tasers to
OL,8,F"protect themselves and their
OL,9,Fcolleagues but also to protect the
OL,10,Fpublic and prevent harm to
OL,11,Findividuals".
